<title>POLAND: BIG JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 3.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>BIG JULY NET FALLS TO PLN 3.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  3.00 vs    5.59</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    3.00 vs    5.59</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  5.71 vs    2.63</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	30.24 vs   22.78</p>
<p> OCTOBER-JULY					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 36.38 vs   48.28</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   36.38 vs   48.28</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 56.23 vs  158.88</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     344.68 vs  387.92</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Inicjatyw</p>
<p>Gospodarczych SA. The bank's fiscal year starts on October 1.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
